# Every text file is checked out with LF line endings, Windows included.
# Git for Windows converts to CRLF by default (core.autocrlf), and the
# scripts here run under bash or inside Linux containers, where a CRLF
# shebang fails as "not found" and every other line ends in a stray \r:
# the web container restarted over and over on a Windows clone.
* text=auto eol=lf
